vim config
==========

Install (Vim 7.4+ reads ~/.vim/vimrc automatically, no symlink needed):

    git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/wjandali/.vim ~/.vim

Then run :Helptags inside Vim to generate plugin docs.

Plugins are git submodules in bundle/, loaded by Pathogen (autoload/pathogen.vim):

    ctrlp.vim      fuzzy file/buffer finder (Ctrl-p)
    nerdcommenter  <Space>c toggles comments
    syntastic      syntax checking; install the checkers you need
                   (e.g. flake8, eslint, shellcheck)

Update plugins:

    git submodule update --remote

Add a plugin:

    git submodule add <url> bundle/<name>

